# Full offline policy; source: deploy/beta-site/privacy*.html, 2026-11-01.
const ZH := "GLory Auto Chess · leno\n\n\n隐私政策\n\nEnglish privacy policy\n\n\n更新日期：2026 年 11 月 1 日\n\n\nGLory Auto Chess 由个人运营者 leno 运营。本政策说明游戏及测试服务如何处理你的信息。隐私问题及数据请求请联系 bytegamesg2025@gmail.com。\n\n\n1. 账号与个人资料\n\n\n游戏首次联网时自动建立匿名游戏账号。我们处理随机生成的玩家编号、好友码、登录会话凭据、昵称、所选头像、头像框和展示宠物，用于识别账号、保存进度及提供社交功能。匿名账号不要求你提供邮箱或密码。\n\n\n你可以选择填写性别、生日的月和日、地区及个人签名，并控制支持隐藏的字段是否公开。地区由你填写，不是通过 GPS 获取。昵称、好友码、头像及你选择公开的资料可被其他玩家看到。不要在昵称、签名或聊天中公开真实住址、电话号码等敏感信息。\n\n\n2. 游戏记录、运行信息与分析\n\n\n我们处理对局与排位记录、游戏进度、虚拟物品及虚拟货币流水、邮件领取、好友关系、在线状态和房间记录，以提供游戏功能、同步状态和处理问题。\n\n\n为了解游戏使用情况及改善稳定性，我们处理登录与活跃时间、在线时长、教学和对局事件、帧率、错误信息、游戏版本、设备型号、操作系统平台、图形处理器、屏幕尺寸、处理器数量、系统语言，以及随机生成的安装和会话编号。网络服务还会处理 IP 地址、请求时间、连接信息及响应状态，用于建立连接、限流、安全防护和排查故障。安装编号不是 IMEI 等硬件序列号。\n\n\n3. 文字聊天与举报\n\n\n发送消息时，文字、发送者标识、时间及相关房间或会话信息会传送到服务器，并向你选择的接收者或频道提供。世界频道的发言可被其他玩家看到；好友私聊向会话双方提供；房间消息向相应房间成员提供。\n\n\n私聊通常保留每对好友最近 200 条消息；解除好友关系后，相关历史最多保留 30 天。世界频道消息通常保留 7 天。房间内实时消息用于转发，客户端会话记录在离开房间后清除。举报时，我们会另行保存相关消息、资料快照和处理记录作为证据，举报证据不随普通聊天记录到期而删除。\n\n\n游戏提供屏蔽、举报及基础文字管控。你也可以不使用聊天功能。\n\n\n4. 语音与麦克风\n\n\n只有你主动开启麦克风并授予系统权限时，游戏才采集你的声音。语音通过加密连接传到我们运营的 LiveKit 语音服务器，并实时转发给界面所示范围的玩家。范围可能为同队队友或房间全部成员；自定义房间开局前可为全房间互通，请留意语音面板上的范围提示。\n\n\n实时语音通话不会被我们录制或存储，也不用于声纹识别或广告。连接日志可能包含玩家标识、语音房间及进入或离开时间，不含语音内容。语音传输采用端到服务器加密，不应理解为只有通话双方能解密的端到端加密。\n\n\n你可以关闭麦克风、屏蔽其他玩家的声音，或在系统设置中撤回麦克风权限。游戏进入后台或离开语音会话后会停止使用麦克风。不开麦也可以游戏。\n\n\n聊天语音消息与实时通话不同：你按住录音并主动发送时，最多 30 秒的声音会上传到服务器、转码并保存，以便相应私聊、世界频道或房间成员播放。私聊语音通常保留 30 天，世界频道及房间／对局语音通常保留 7 天；被举报的语音至少保留 60 天，处理或调查期间可能继续保留。清理按任务周期执行，且仍被记录引用的音频不会立即删除。语音文件采用内容哈希地址分发；取得文件链接的人可能访问音频，请勿发送敏感信息。你可以不使用录音功能。\n\n\n5. 服务提供方与数据传输\n\n\n我们使用云服务器、数据库、身份验证和内容分发服务来运行游戏，包括 Google Cloud、Supabase，以及用于资源分发的 Google Firebase 服务。它们可能为提供服务而处理账号标识、网络请求和相应运行数据。语音使用开源 LiveKit/WebRTC 技术及我们运营的服务器。\n\n\nGoogle Play、Google 群组及 Apple TestFlight 等安装或测试平台按照各自的隐私政策处理平台账号、加入测试和下载信息。游戏服务器及服务提供方可能位于你所在国家或地区以外。\n\n\n我们不出售个人信息，不将聊天或语音用于广告，游戏不包含广告。可用时，钻石购买通过 Apple App Store、Google Play 或 Steam 平台支付完成。平台处理支付信息；我们核验签名交易或购买凭证，处理订单、虚拟货币到账、退款及防止重复发放，不接收银行卡完整号码。购买可用性和价格取决于平台、商店地区及商品状态。除你主动发起的社交分享、提供服务所需的处理及依法履行义务外，我们不会向无关第三方提供你的个人信息。\n\n\n6. 保存期限与账号删除\n\n\n账号资料和进度在提供服务期间保存；聊天按第 3 节的规则处理。运行日志按服务器日志轮转规则覆盖，目前没有对所有日志设置统一的固定天数。对局、虚拟物品流水、处罚及举报证据目前属于长期保留记录，尚未设置统一的自动到期删除期限，用于核对游戏记录、处理争议和防止滥用。\n\n\n你可以在游戏的个人资料页使用“注销账号”，输入自己的好友码确认。此操作会删除个人资料、好友和普通聊天数据、账号关联的活跃与客户端分析记录，清除展示信息并使原账号无法恢复。部分游戏流水、对局及安全处理记录会保留；举报证据可能包含当时复制的聊天和资料。身份验证服务中的匿名技术记录可能保留。保留记录并不等于所有信息都已不可逆匿名化。\n\n\n也可以不打开游戏，按照账号与数据删除说明向我们提出删除或访问、更正请求。我们会核实账号归属，说明处理范围及仍需保留的信息。请勿发送密码、登录令牌或身份证件。\n\n\n7. 未成年人\n\n\n本次测试面向 13 岁及以上用户。当地法律或平台分级要求更高年龄时，应遵守相应要求。未成年人应在监护人指导下使用游戏和社交功能；需要监护人同意时，应先取得同意。本游戏不面向 13 岁以下儿童。监护人如发现儿童信息被不当处理，可通过上述邮箱联系我们。\n\n\n8. 安全、选择与更新\n\n\n我们通过加密传输、访问权限和服务端校验保护数据，但任何网络服务都无法保证绝对安全。你可以调整个人资料可见性、停止聊天或语音、撤回麦克风权限，或申请注销账号。卸载游戏不会自动删除服务器上的账号数据。\n\n\n功能或数据处理方式变化时，我们会更新本政策及日期；重大变化会通过适当方式通知。隐私及数据请求联系：bytegamesg2025@gmail.com。"
const EN := "GLory Auto Chess Privacy Policy\n\nUpdated November 1, 2026. Operated by leno. Privacy contact: bytegamesg2025@gmail.com.\n\nAccounts and profile\n\nThe game creates an anonymous account for progress and multiplayer. We process player IDs, friend codes, session credentials, nicknames, selected avatars and cosmetics. Email and password are not required for guest play. Optional profile fields include gender, birthday month/day, region and a signature. Region is entered by you, not obtained through GPS. Public profile information is visible to other players.\n\nGame data and diagnostics\n\nWe process progress, match and ranking records, virtual-item and currency transactions, mail claims, friends, rooms and online status. To operate and improve the game we process activity times, tutorial and gameplay events, frame rate, errors, game version, device model, OS, GPU, screen size, processor count, language and random installation/session IDs. Network requests include IP addresses, times and connection information for connectivity, security, rate limiting and troubleshooting.\n\nText and voice\n\nText messages and sender IDs are delivered to their selected recipients or channels. Private chat normally keeps the latest 200 messages per friend pair; after friendship removal, related history is retained for up to 30 days. World chat normally retains messages for 7 days. Reports may preserve messages, profile snapshots and investigation records beyond ordinary retention.\n\nMicrophone access is optional. Live voice is encrypted in transit to our LiveKit server and forwarded to the participants shown in the interface. We do not record or store live calls. This is transport encryption, not a claim of end-to-end encryption. Voice-room and connection logs may contain player IDs and join/leave times.\n\nRecorded voice messages are different from live calls. When you record and send a message, up to 30 seconds of audio is uploaded, transcoded and stored for recipients to play. Private voice messages normally expire after 30 days; world and room/match messages after 7 days. Reported audio is held for at least 60 days and may be retained longer while investigated. Periodic cleanup and references can delay physical file deletion. Audio is delivered through content-hash URLs; someone who obtains a URL may access its audio. Do not send sensitive information. Recording is not required to play.\n\nProviders, advertising and international processing\n\nWe use Google Cloud, Supabase, Firebase and our own LiveKit services for hosting, authentication, storage and delivery. Data may be processed outside your country. We do not sell personal information or use chat or voice for advertising. The game has no ads. Where available, diamond purchases use Apple App Store, Google Play or Steam billing. Platforms process payment details; we verify signed transactions or purchase proofs and process orders, virtual currency delivery, refunds and duplicate-delivery prevention. We do not receive full payment-card numbers. Purchase availability and prices depend on the platform, storefront and product status. Distribution platforms process their own account and download data under their policies.\n\nRetention and deletion\n\nAccount and progress data are kept while providing service. Logs rotate; there is no single fixed retention period for all logs. Match, virtual-item, penalty and report records may be retained long-term for support, disputes and abuse prevention.\n\nIn the player profile choose Delete Account / 注销账号 and confirm your friend code. This removes profile, friend and ordinary chat data, related activity/analytics records and display information, and makes the old account unrecoverable. Some match, transaction, safety and report records may remain, including copied report evidence and anonymous technical authentication records. Retained data is not necessarily irreversibly anonymized. You can also email support to request deletion, access or correction; we verify account ownership and explain any remaining records. Never send passwords or tokens.\n\nYour choices and minors\n\nYou may avoid chat, decline microphone access, mute players, report abuse, restrict supported profile fields or delete your account. Uninstalling does not delete server data. The game is not directed to children under 13; follow higher local or platform age requirements. We use encryption and access controls but cannot guarantee absolute security. Material changes will be reflected in this policy and appropriate notices.\n\nSupport · 中文"
